title: 'Read-only commands spew ''fatal: not a git repository'' to stderr when run outside a repo'
---
c2c whoami, c2c status, c2c doctor all print fatal: not a git repository even though they don't need to be in a repo. whoami/status still work; output is just noisy. Repro: cd /tmp && c2c status